Not to be confused with curse or dark magic, poison magic is the simple art of combining existing poisons into a single spell and manipulating its behavior. It is very rare for a magician to make their own poison for that requires vast knowledge in a field most magician don't have any experience in. While there are a few that do exist, most are content with using existing poisons and mixing them together.
