''We're rich!''
Pots O' Gold - otherwise known as ''Liquid Profits'' - has been known to instill any red-blooded kappa/yamawaro with sharply enhanced senses and an impressive lust for sweet, sweet profit...profit...PROFIT! Riches surely await anyone lucky enough partake of this elusive brew.

