''Welcome to the land where common sense goes to die.''
A magilock that somehow ended up having the role of both a shotgun and sniper rifle due to its unconventional design. In the youkai's pursuit of developing a weapon that can handle more powerful magishot, the excess magical residue that escaped from the rifle when fired created 'pellets' which retained some of its lethality before fizzling out. This made the weapon even more lethal in close quarters than its intended range.
^orange;Not Another Step: 1s PARRY WINDOW | 10HP STABILITY^reset;

''Whether they be beast or man. A bolt to the head will kill both.''
