And here is the basic processing logic of this machine.

All the ^orange;raw ^white;food will be divided into 4 classes.
  ^yellow;C-Cereal. ^white;Like corn, rice, wheat.
  ^green;F-Fruit. ^white;Like banana,carrot, tomato.
  ^red;P-Protein. ^white;Like alienmeat, milk, egg.
  ^blue;S-Spice. ^white;Like chili, and all glitch food.
And here is the recipe:
  Tier4: ^yellow;C^white;+^red;P^white;+^green;F^white;+^blue;S^white;
  Tier3: ^yellow;C^white;+^red;P^white;+^blue;S^white;, ^yellow;C^white;+^green;F^white;+^blue;S^white;
  Tier2: ^yellow;C^white;+^red;P^white;, ^yellow;C^white;+^green;F^white;, ^green;F^white;+^red;P^white;, ^red;P^white;+^blue;S^white;
  Tier1: ^yellow;C^white;, ^red;P^white;, ^green;F^white;, ^blue;S^white;

