Bion is the primary material that makes up majority of any bion connections and variations, the most common of which is the naturally occurring bionid. Refining it into pure bion and further reinforcing it into a compound makes it a perfect armoring material. Pure bion is not as luminescent, but is very bendable and adaptable.  
Popular bion compounds and variations include materials like **bionium**, **dianid** or **bionix**.  
Read more about bionics here: ^#299fc5;Bionics^reset;

