Considered to be the first of its kind from the Lion's homeland, the L44 is an assault rifle that fires rifle round cartridges in rapid fire at the cost of only some accuracy. Specialized equipment has been put onto the rifle to provide the user better vision within the thick forests of the mountain and to level the playing field against the wolf's tengu unparallel vision.
Accepts 30rnd 7.92x33mm magazines.
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

Converted Avtomat Shturmovoy 12.7mm, modified to accept the relatively common 12.7x42mm cartridge due to the original 12.7x55mm ammunition being too difficult to find outside United Systems.

