^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

Copy of an American Ithaca M37 shotgun, produced in small numbers by local gun factories throughout Asia. Some ''volunteers'' from Imperial Vietnamese Army brought these to India, where their reliability and handiness made them quite popular even within IJA ranks.
Uses 18.50x70mm Shotgun Shells.

^orange;Slam-Fire: Trigger can be held down to fire at a rapid rate, but recoil recovery is significantly slower than other shotguns.^reset;

