^#8020f0;Spooksmen - Professional Scares^reset;

These outer space experts in creating eerie atmospheres collaborate with altas to enhance Ceternity! Known for their professional scaring skills, spooksmen add extra excitement and mystery to celebrations.

They take spookiness seriously - but in a fun way!

^#8020f0;The Spooks of Ceternity^reset;

It's the spooky season!

The Hallowing Ceternity wouldn't be complete without its cast of spooky characters! From mysterious beings to mischievous candy thieves, here's your guide to the (mostly!) friendly faces of the spook night.

^#8080f0;Enchanted^reset;
Also known as Viona, enchanted areas are anomalous places where different types of energy merge and combine, creating a highly unstable environment.

^#f02020;EDS^reset;
A militaristic alta faction centered around protecting altas against various threats. Lately, something went wrong with their command centers, leading to defensive technology going rogue.

^#858585;..They chased us. The enemy ship has an Warp signal jammer. ^green;All units, Get ready to board the enemy ship.^white; This is our last chance!
Pilot, Prepare the ship for a full speed attack. We're not going down here. 
^green;We're going to give it everything we've got!^white;

^#8C8D90;Illuminated^white;

^#8C8D90;Illuminated^white; is the most important and representative planet among Pale stars, covered by exotic and white landscape.
Faded ^#8C8D90;Holosium Fragments^white; and green ^#6AC57D;Renatines^white; fill the earth of Illuminated planet. The former can be melt into ^orange;Holosium Bars^white; and both of them are important materials.

^#8EEFD6;Arcane Weald^white;

^#8EEFD6;Arcane Weald^white; is the most important and representative planet in Arcane stars. The planet is mainly covered by cyan forests filled with Arcane energy, but other mysterious landscapes can occasionally be found there as well. 
The notable mineral here is ^#8EEFD6;Arcanium Ore^white; in the color of cyan, which can be used to craft basic Arcane equipments after being melted. This planet is also the only place to find ^#b7b7c0;Borealite^white;.

^#8a9855;Natural Comfort^reset;
Get ready to sink into a cloud of comfort! Our Natural Comfort collection is all about plush sofas, luxurious armchairs, and soft mattresses to ease your daily life.

^#8a9855;Functional Living^reset;
Living in a cozy corner or a snug apartment? No worries! Our Functional Living collection is all about smart solutions and furniture that pulls double duty, making your space work for you.

^#99BBFF;The Spirit Guardian^reset; is a lifeform that exists within plants and animals. They are active, kind, and helpful creatures. Once their homeland has enough Spirit Trees to maintain the balance of the ecosystem, they will turn their attention to further worlds, in hopes of finding lands that require their power.

