^#9D2F32;''Smart'' doesn't equal ''expensive''.^reset;
The minds at Serbia-based Rostović set out to prove that ''smart'' doesn't have to mean ''expensive.'' The fruit of their endeavor is the Palica. its price is certainly lower than the competition. This shotgun possesses the basic funtionality of a Smart-class shotgun, but it's not enough to compare it to Arasaka or Tsunami weapons. Still, for those whose wallets are already squeezed, the Palica really is the ''smart'' choice.
^#FFD83F;Smart weapon: ^#D1A02E; Require Smart Link System. tracking targets

^#9D2F32;A firearm staple since 2020.^reset;
This powerful shotgun, Militech Crusher designed for short - range combat, was first created in the year 2020, soon becoming one of the period's most iconic weapons. Once standard - issue among corporate guards, today the Crusher is more popular among mercs with a nostalgia. ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [12 gauge Buckshot].
^#FFD83F;Heavy Weapons: ^#D1A02E;Musculoskeletal cyberware is required.^red; If not, Your arms will be shattered. ^red;No Crouching bonuses, Short range.^reset;

^#9D2F32;A versatile weapon for versatile combatants.^reset;
Once upon a time, The world's most popular assault rifle was the AK-47. Today, 2077's market niche was replaced by the Nokota Copperhead. This mass-produced assault rifle sticks to the basics of functionability and reliability. There's no ingenuity to fall in love with, but many people find its dependable stopping power an endearing trait. ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [5.56x45mm]
^#FFD83F;Power weapon: ^#D1A02E;Can use Ricochet attachment.
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

