The preferred pistol among Night City cops - light, wieldy and easy on the recoil, it's perfect for taking down enemies without necessarily killing them on the spot. Thanks to its relatively small dimensions, the gun has also found a loyal following among those who prefer a concealed carry: the Lexington easily fits in a coat pocket or purse. ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [9x19mm]
^#FFD83F;Power weapon: ^#D1A02E;Can use Ricochet attachment.
