The Soviet arms giant Techtronika are driven by two core metrics: firepower and reliability. A simple design means fewer opportunity for breakage or jamming. The only knocks against this weapon are its relatively powerful kick. Consider investing in cyberware to absorb the recoil. Techtronika will not be held liable for a user's shattered bones. ^#9CD5F0;Using Custom ammunition [8 gauge Buckshot]
^#FFD83F;Heavy Weapons: ^#D1A02E;Musculoskeletal cyberware is advised.^red; If not, Your arms will be shattered.^reset;

