Midnight Arms' light machine gun is ''light'' in name only. The MA70 HB is a bona fide steel cannon for your personal arsenal. Should you dare to shoulder their behemoth LMG, the MA70 HB, it's wise to first install cyberware to reinforce your upper body and spine. ^red;Wielding this without the proper structural precautions will likely mean a trip to the ripperdoc for both you and your target.^reset; ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [7.7x56mm]
