^#9D2F32;Masamune - power reimagined.^reset;
The Masamune is not just a rifle but a work of fine art. Designed in the 50's and manufactured from the best, most resilient materials, the Masamune is great for all conditions, while also being surprisingly light. Every single one of the Masamune's elements were quality-ensured by a legion of Arasaka engineers - and you can feel it. ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [7.7x56mm]
