True amateur gearheads generally avoid automatic transmissions, claiming it takes away their control. The same goes for gun enthusiasts who think that modern pistols and rifles are too comfortable and convenient. The solution for purists and analog-minded gun owners is the Liberty from Constitutional Arms. This pistol was created with one main purpose in mind - to fire bullets. ^#9CD5F0;Using standard ammunition [.45 ACP]
