To all my beloved sisters across the stars,

As Alecta 10 begins its first cycle, I write to you with warmth in my heart and hope for our shared future.

^#b0e0fc;Sonaveil Celebration Guide^reset;

A warm holiday during the coldest times!

Sona's Veil is our cold solstice celebration - a time to gather, stay warm, and enjoy the beauty of the cold season together! This guide will help you celebrate properly~

^#bea04d;Stahlern Badlands^white;

As its name suggests, the ^#bea04d;Stahlern Badland^white; is a rusty planet, a paradise for dangerous scavengers, bandits and mercenaries. 
The weaponary they use requires a native mineral called ^#bea04d;Verrostin Ore^white;.

^#c3483a;Vermilion^white;

^#c3483a;Vermilion^white; is occupied by an dictatorship called Exousian. The planet is specially infused with ^orange;Vermilion Essence^white;.
Three different kind of ores are buried beneath the crimson forests as follows: ^#e06d60;Rufescites^white;, ^#525252;Exoslate Fragments^white; and ^#dedede;Enartz Fragment^white;.

^#c38166;Amorous^white;

^#c38166;Amorous^white; is a lush planet bathed in eternal sunset, rich in gems and other luxury resources. Many nobles have settled here for the planet's beautiful rivers and skies.
Nothing special's about these planets.

^#d1a733;Timeless^white;

^#d1a733;Timeless^white; is literally a planet of no time. Countless spikes of brown and blue pierce the entire land.
Beneath the earth are blue ^#27b2ec;Raw Diathryliums^white;, a kind of rare ores that can only be found here.

^#d6642e;Runic Desert^white;

These ancient ^#d6642e;Runic Deserts^white; harbour ruins that have existed since time immemorial. Another good place for ^#8EEFD6;Arcanium Ore^white; and ^orange;Magifire Crystals^white;.
You can also find ^green;great Arcane Cities of Arcanian^white;here.

^#e4c6ff;Eminsnow^white;

^#e4c6ff;Eminsnow^white; is a beautiful purple planet covered in soft snow. It's the origin of ^orange;Cerulean Roll^white;, a famous fruit snack.
^#e4c6ff;Luminarium Ores^white; are found exclusively in these planets.

^#e7c475;Azure Desert^white;

Most Arcanian, specially mages and alchemists, choose to live in ^#e7c475;Azure Deserts^white; now, as these desert planets resemble their former home most. Another good place to find ^green;Arcane City^white; as well.
The metal they mainly use is produced by smelting a local mineral called ^#4bb4ca;Azurium Ore^white;.

^#ec9858;Solarized^white;

^#ec9858;Solarized^white; is an orange forest planet of heat. ^#ec9858;Atumium ores^white; can be discovered there.
^orange;Giant shadow spires^white; can be spotted here, with a portal to a ^green;Solar Corridor^white; at their tops.

