^#f02080;Lighthearted Spooks^reset;

Despite all the eerie atmosphere and mysterious beings, Ceternity remains a cheerful celebration! The spooks are friendly, the scares are fun, and everyone's here to enjoy the season.

So don't be afraid - embrace the spookiness and join the party! Just maybe keep your candy somewhere safe...

^#f3ff92;Viridescent^white;

^#f3ff92;Viridescent^white; are poisoning planets with a chartreuse color. One may burn to death by ^orange;Viridescent Acid^white; there before killed by the frequent acid rain. Another ideal places for the ^yellow;Anarkyons^white; gang.
Occasional ^#bea04d;Corrodium Ores^white; can be found among black rocks and green soils.

^#f8bcc8;Senbonzakura^white;

^#f8bcc8;Senbonzakura^white; is a planet full of cherry blossom. The planet's name is a reference to a famous Hylotl song. Nothing special about it other than that.
A ^orange;shrine^white; guarded by Hylotl can be found in both ^#e4c6ff;Eminsnow^white; and ^#f8bcc8;Senbonzakura^white;, where you will find a portal to a ^green;Lunar Corridor^white;.

^#ff60a0;Costume Strategy^reset;

Here's the secret: dress in scary costumes so the spooks think you're one of them! They'll share their candy instead of stealing yours.

Elegant dark dresses, vampire costumes, witch robes - anything spooky works! The better your costume, the more treats you might receive~

^#ff8080;Stay Warm Together^reset;

The holiday's core message is simple: stay warm together when it's cold outside! This means both literal warmth and emotional warmth through gathering with your sisters.

Wrap up in warm blankets, wear layers, and most importantly - huddle together for warmth and comfort~

^#ffa8e8;Stardust Orchid - Candy Thief!^reset;

Watch your treats! The Orchid loves to trick silly altas and steal their Ceternity candies.

If you see mysterious stardust sparkles near your candy stash, she's probably nearby! Don't worry though - she's more playful than scary~

^#ffb3eb;Neon Sea^white;

^#ffb3eb;Neon Sea^white; is a purple marine planet made up of ^orange;Neon Water^white;, the main source of ^orange;Electric Essence^white;.
Abundant ^#9c36cb;Electrolite Ores^white; can also be found here.

^#ffd080;Holiday Spirit^reset;

During Sonaveil, you might receive gifts of Holiday Spirit - symbolic tokens representing the season's joy and community warmth!

These little items carry the festive atmosphere with them. Some say they're made from concentrated celebration energy itself!

^#ffd080;String Lights & Decorations^reset;

Hang colorful string lights everywhere! They brighten the long dark nights and create such a warm, festive atmosphere.

Wall scarves and fabric hangings add color and coziness to indoor spaces. The warm reds, yellows, and whites contrast beautifully with the cold blue snow outside!

