^green;Ameraucana^reset;
Ameraucanas are broody. They like to sit on a clutch of eggs to incubate them, although they might not even be fertilized.
Their ^yellow;main purpose^reset; is for ^green;eggs^reset;. They lay blue eggs and their egg production is ^green;250 eggs annually^reset;.

^green;Barred Plymouth Rock^reset;
Barred Plymouth Rocks are calm, nice chickens!
They are ^green;dual-purpose^reset;, raised both for meat and eggs. They lay large, brown or light brown eggs and their egg production is ^green;280 eggs annually^reset;.

^green;Blue-Laced Wyandotte^reset;
Blue-Laced Wyandottes are docile, loving chickens!
They are ^green;dual-purpose^reset;, raised both for meat and eggs. They lay large, brown or tan eggs and their egg production is ^green;200 eggs annually^reset;.

^green;Buff Orpington^reset;
Buff Orpingtons are calm, gentle chickens!
They are ^green;dual-purpose^reset;, raised both for meat and eggs. They lay light brown eggs and their egg production is ^green;190 eggs annually^reset;.

